# GetViaMsg showcase

> gvm.js developer showcase: working, bilingual (PL/EN) examples of content
> monetization with GetViaMsg micropayments (SMS / QR). Every example runs
> against the QA tenant — no real charge.

## Use cases

### Publishers — /publisher/
- Unlock an article — /publisher/unlock-article/ — free opening, inline paywall, `hide` strategy.
- Ad-free day — /publisher/remove-ads/ — ad slots + sticky bar, 24-hour pass via the `redirect` strategy.

### Digital commerce — /digital-ecommerce/
One shop page, one section per use case: e-book, music file, high-resolution
photo, PDF report, audiobook and pay-per-view. Uses the `download` and `inject`
strategies.

### SaaS — /saas/
- Selling plans — /saas-licenses/ — plan cards, confirmed with a single SMS and settled together.
- Add-ons and basket — /add-ons/ — a configurator whose basket total is the payment amount (dynamic price, lazy SDK boot).

## Overlay — /overlay/
gvm-overlay.js: drop in one script tag and the service finds and locks the
content itself. Three English-only editorial demos: blur, hide, mangle-blur.

## Templates (section on the homepage)
- Payment forms: drawer (the default), modal, simple, circle.
- Paywall placements — /templates/placements/ — inline, overlay, sticky bottom,
  sticky right, widget, banner, drawer.

